MODULE: CrashForgetsAbandoned
TARGET: NoPrematureRetirement
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: crash forgets the durable abandoned batch before the all-shard decision
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
    /\ crashes' = crashes+1
    /\ UNCHANGED <<length, installed, value, ckpt, abandoned, wal, heads, floor, shadow,
--- REPLACE
    /\ crashes' = crashes+1 /\ abandoned' = FALSE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<length, installed, value, ckpt, wal, heads, floor, shadow,
--- END
